{
  "id": "E184",
  "title": "The Annual Party is Coming",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2018-01-06",
  "synopsis": "Mr Wang is asking his secretary about the arrangements for the annual party.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/623/f45a0337506ad79985486eb23265da7b725ca89d.mp3?1514559709",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "年会就要到了\n\n王总：今年年会的安排都定好了吧？\n小张：是的。今年的年会在国际会议中心举行。下午2点开始，晚上9点结束。\n王总：都打算邀请哪些嘉宾？\n小张：根据公关部的建议，一共需要邀请20位嘉宾，这是名单。\n王总：务必要招待好这些嘉宾。酒店都订好了吗？\n小张：都已经订好了，是市中心的一家五星级酒店 。\n王总：好。年会上的发言稿呢？拿来让我看看。\n小张：请稍等，我这就去拿。",
    "traditional": "年會就要到了\n\n王總：今年年會的安排都定好了吧？\n小張：是的。今年的年會在國際會議中心舉行。下午2點開始，晚上9點結束。\n王總：都打算邀請哪些嘉賓？\n小張：根據公關部的建議，一共需要邀請20位嘉賓，這是名單。\n王總：務必要招待好這些嘉賓。酒店都訂好了嗎？\n小張：都已經訂好了，是市中心的一家五星級酒店 。\n王總：好。年會上的發言稿呢？拿來讓我看看。\n小張：請稍等，我這就去拿。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Annual Party is Coming"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：今年年会的安排都定好了吧？",
      "traditional": "王總：今年年會的安排都定好了吧？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng jīn nián nián huì de ān pái dōu dìng hǎo le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Are all the arrangement for this year's annual party done yet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：是的。今年的年会在国际会议中心举行。",
      "traditional": "小張：是的。今年的年會在國際會議中心舉行。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shì de jīn nián de nián huì zài guó jì huì yì zhōng xīn jǔ xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "下午2点开始，晚上9点结束。",
      "traditional": "下午2點開始，晚上9點結束。",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ 1 diǎn kāi shǐ wǎn shang 1 diǎn jié shù",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes. This year the annual party will be held at the international conference center."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It starts at 2 pm, and ends at 9 pm."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "王总：都打算邀请哪些嘉宾？",
      "traditional": "王總：都打算邀請哪些嘉賓？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng dōu dǎ suàn yāo qǐng nǎ xiē jiā bīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Who are we going to invite?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小张：根据公关部的建议，一共需要邀请20位嘉宾，这是名单。",
      "traditional": "小張：根據公關部的建議，一共需要邀請20位嘉賓，這是名單。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng gēn jù gōng guān bù de jiàn yì yí gòng xū yào yāo qǐng 2 wèi jiā bīn zhè shì míng dān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: According to the PR department we need to invite 20 special guests. Here is the list."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "王总：务必要招待好这些嘉宾。酒店都订好了吗？",
      "traditional": "王總：務必要招待好這些嘉賓。酒店都訂好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng wù bì yào zhāo dài hǎo zhè xiē jiā bīn jiǔ diàn dōu dìng hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: We must treat them all well. Is the hotel ready?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小张：都已经订好了，是市中心的一家五星级酒店 。",
      "traditional": "小張：都已經訂好了，是市中心的一家五星級酒店 。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng dōu yǐ jīng dìng hǎo le shì shì zhōng xīn de yì jiā wǔ xīng jí jiǔ diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It has all been prepared. It is a five star hotel located in the city center."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "王总：好。年会上的发言稿呢？拿来让我看看。",
      "traditional": "王總：好。年會上的發言稿呢？拿來讓我看看。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng hǎo nián huì shang de fā yán gǎo ne ná lái ràng wǒ kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Sounds good. Where's the speech for the annual party? Let me have a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小张：请稍等，我这就去拿。",
      "traditional": "小張：請稍等，我這就去拿。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng qǐng shāo děng wǒ zhè jiù qù ná",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Please wait a moment. I'm going to fetch it."
    }
  ],
